OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRather cloudy in the Central
OL,6,FBelt and in Lanarkshire with a chance
OL,7,Fof the odd light shower. Elsewhere dry
OL,8,Fwith brighter spells building into the
OL,9,Fafternoon, particularly in Argyll and
OL,10,FAyrshire. Winds light.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FStaying dry. Central Belt
OL,13,Frather cloudy again, with best of the
OL,14,Fclear spells in Argyll and Ayrshire.
OL,15,FChance of frost and fog patches
OL,16,Fovernight, chiefly for rural parts.
OL,17,FLight winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
